Netflix VMAF
============

This directory redistributes licensing materials for the official Netflix VMAF
project (https://github.com/Netflix/vmaf), used by PixVQA for optional CPU VMAF
v1 evaluation via libvmaf 3.2.1.

Pinned upstream revision
------------------------

- Repository: https://github.com/Netflix/vmaf
- Tag: v3.2.1
- Commit: f85a853692a8c730d0270cd733c8bb30b5b93b7c

Vendored model JSON assets
--------------------------

The eight VMAF v1.0.16 model JSON files under `model/` in this repository are
exact byte copies of the corresponding files from the pinned Netflix commit.
See `model/README.md` and `reports/VMAF_MODEL_CHECKSUMS.md`.

